      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.07,
      "end_seconds": 293.18,
      "duration_seconds": 21.11,
      "text": "alright, migraines, that that matches what I have here from what you've told me and what I found, it points towards suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors the reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together"
