      "start_seconds": 300.2,
      "end_seconds": 319.77,
      "duration_seconds": 19.57,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors. Let's use levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms once a day long term. You take it by mouth. It's for contraception"
